            nil: error (unlikely to happen)

        Example:
            * white space strip example

            ```
            ret = axlStringCSVParse(" a ,b" t)

            -> ( "a" "b")
            ```

            * properly parse a csv file

            ```
            ret = axlStringCSVParse("a,,c,\\"d,e\\"" )

            -> ( "a" "" "c" "d,e")
            ```

            * properly parse a csv file

            ```
            ret = axlStringCSVParse("a||c|\\"d|e\\"" nil "|" )
