    LINES with the interface are supported even though lines do not merge.

    Allegro restricts the layers that allow fonts (s_font). ETCH layers may never have fonted lines.

    Args:
        r_path: Existing path consisting of the straight-line and arc segments previously created by`axlPath` functions
        t_layer: Layer on which to create a path figure. Default is the active layer.
        t_net_name: Name of the net to which the path figure is to belong.`axlDBCreatePath` ignores `t_netName` if`t_netName`is non-`nil` and `t_layer` is not an etch layer. If the net`t_netName` does not exist, `axlDBCreatePath` does not create any path, and returns `nil`.
