        group_mode: Default is for`axlSelect` to return when the user makes a selection. If groupMode is `'t`, `axlSelect` won't return until you do an `axlCancelEnterFun` or `axlFinishEnterFun`. You perform all of your activity in popup callbacks instead of when `axlSelect` returns. In `groupMode`, `axlSelect` does not clear existing selections. To clear existing selections after the first event, clear them in your `firstEventCallback`.
        prompt: Prompt to the user. The default prompt is: "`Enter selection point`"

