        q = axlUIMenuFind( nil "add rect")

        z = axlUIMenuInsert(q 'separator )
        ```

        * Add a web link at the top of the help menu

        ```
        q = axlUIMenuFind( nil -1 'top)

        z = axlUIMenuInsert(q "Google" "http http://google.com" )
