    `shape = axlDBCreateOpenShape(...)`

    `... add voids ...`

    `axlDBCreateCloseShape(shape).`

    You can modify an existing shape by using the axlDBOpenShape command, as follows:

    `axlDBOpenShape(shape <new boundary>)`

    `... add or delete voids ...`

