        end_cap_type: Keyword string specifying the end cap type to use for the polygon, one of`'SQUARE`, `'OCTAGON`, or `'ROUND`. Used in case of line or cline only, otherwise ignored. Default is `'SQUARE`.
        layer: Keyword string specifying the layer of the pad to retrieve, for example,`"ETCH/TOP"`. Used in the case of pin or via only, otherwise ignored. Default is `"ETCH/TOP"`.
        pad_type: Keyword string specifying the type of the pad to be retrieved, one of`'REGULAR`, `'ANTI`, or `'THERMAL`. Used for pins, vias, or if `r_path` is based with the `line2poly` option, otherwise ignored. Default is `'REGULAR`.
