        nil: No timer added.

    Example:
        * Basic:

        ```
        procedure( YourSkillProcedure(); set up a continuous timer using the main windowtimerId = axlUIWTimerAdd(nil 2000 nil 'YourTimerCallback)timerId->yourData = yourdata)
